A||||0||Mattsfiero||An Awsome time at Kick Hill!!!!!||||1||
Z||000000||Mattsfiero||08-27-2000||01:29 PM||||Well we all had a great weekend. Saturday there were plenty of cars and people at the Kick Hill emporium in Lebonon, CT. I will tell you the place is a dream come true for all fiero owners....You name the part no matter how small and for what year, it was there for the Buying. The people there where great and very friendly. The event although hosted by Bob Parker the owner and Honorary member of NEFOA & MAFOA who hosted it was the greatest fun. I will post pictures of the event as I get them scanned.<P>Matt||||reg||1
